\label{lem:Holder-time}
For any initial state $\mathfrak{h}_0$ satisfying Assumption~\ref{a:initial_state_pd}(a), $L > 0$,  $0 < T_0 < T$ and  $\delta\in (0,\tfrac13]$, one has almost surely
\begin{equation}
