by noting that $F_{\delta}(y,s,x,t) \leq F_\delta(M,T,L,T)$ and considering the value of the remaining expression at $y = x$, which satisfies $|y| \leq M$ by assuming $M>L$ if necessary. This completes the proof of Lemma~\ref{lem:Holder-time}.

