Denoting $p(u) := p_1(u)$, using the scaling property of the heat kernel $p_{\delta}(\sqrt{\delta} u) = p(u) / \sqrt \delta$, and changing the integration variable $v = \sqrt \delta w$, the integral in \eqref{eq:heat2} can be written as
\begin{align}\label{eq:change_of_variables}
