&= - \varrho\Gamma(\mathbf{S}_{1/2,-L})^* \mathbf{Q}_L^{(\eta_1; \star)} \mathbf{S}_{1/2,-L} \Gamma\varrho.\label{eq:limit1}
\end{align}
By \eqref{eq:A1_formula}, this is equal to the operator $-\mathbf{A}_L^{(\eta_1; \star)}$, which is trace class and rank-one.
